      "question_class": "multi_call",
      "question": "In the Quantum Designs partnership, which competitor did Nia Adetokunbo say fell short on customization, and what total contract value did she ultimately agree to sign?",
      "gold_answer": "NanoDesign fell short on customization; Quantum Designs agreed to a total of $8,719.81.",
