          "kind": "dialogue",
          "line_start": 9,
          "line_end": 10,
          "quote": "[2021-03-15T14:12:32] Nia Adetokunbo: That's reassuring. We've been comparing with NanoDesign, and while their vendor stability and roadmap are notable, they just don't meet our customization needs as well.",
