          "kind": "dialogue",
          "line_start": 12,
          "line_end": 14,
          "quote": "[2021-05-05T11:33:15] Adebola Adeyemi: Yes, the total comes to $8,719.81, with discounts applied to the SecureFlow Suite and EduTech Lab. Shall we proceed with signing the contract?\n[2021-05-05T11:33:30] Nia Adetokunbo: Everything sounds good to us. We\u2019re ready to sign off and look forward to a prosperous partnership with TechPulse.",
