      "question": "What concern did Zainab Khader at FusionTech Systems raise about TechPulse's pricing in the initial discussion, and which competitor did she later raise as a concern during onboarding?",
      "gold_answer": "Initially she was concerned about higher upfront costs; later she raised Adaptive Design Solutions' appealing user experience as a competitive concern.",
